  "text": "proprium.maternitas-beatae-mariae-virginis-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Maternity of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Through Your mercy, O Lord, and by the intercession of blessed Mary, ever Virgin, the Mother of Your only-begotten Son, may this offering profit us for prosperity and peace, now and forevermore. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God," },
    "s02": { "translation": "world without end." },
    "s03": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
